msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:365
#: 6137d20a76b541f088ff29e13e882cc6
msgid "Logs will appear in **/var/APM/logs** for QFLIGHT ARM port and in **/usr/share/data/adsp/logs** for the QURT port."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:368
#: d656748b9e9d4be3a899e5a585145fcc
msgid "You can copy the logs over WiFi using FTP, Samba, SCP or any other common file copying tool (the board runs Samba by default, so you can just add the log directory to the Samba config file to export it, and then drag and drop from Windows). On QFLIGHT you can also download logs over MAVLink."
msgstr ""

